{"2325340": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "BeDo", "steam_appid": 2325340, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Master Momentum</strong>: A Precision Platformer Without Jumping</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BeDo</strong> is a test of <strong>fluid movement</strong> set in a vibrant cosmos. Forget everything you know about platformers: here, there is <strong>no jump button</strong>. Your survival depends entirely on your ability to <strong>slide, dash, and glide</strong> with surgical precision.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2325340/extras/adac7e2a9b9aa004d1dfb7789c6cf532.poster.avif?t=1777559648\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2325340/extras/adac7e2a9b9aa004d1dfb7789c6cf532.webm?t=1777559648\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2325340/extras/adac7e2a9b9aa004d1dfb7789c6cf532.mp4?t=1777559648\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pilot a cute dough</strong> through the universe to defy the Somber Slumber that wants to shut off creation itself. It is accessible to start, but brutal for those seeking <strong>100% completion</strong>. Can you handle the momentum in a space filled with hazards?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2325340/extras/01a387e0803bbfcf6869fe6f18e9c2e4.poster.avif?t=1777559648\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2325340/extras/01a387e0803bbfcf6869fe6f18e9c2e4.webm?t=1777559648\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2325340/extras/01a387e0803bbfcf6869fe6f18e9c2e4.mp4?t=1777559648\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Movement-Based Precision:</strong> Full 360-degree control. Master the art of the spatial slide to navigate lethal traps.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Collector’s Odyssey:</strong> Discover 350 scattered pieces of Dough and 105 hidden planetoids across 40+ handcrafted levels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Subversive Atmosphere:</strong> A hypnotic lo-fi aesthetic paired with a &quot;dazzlingly atmospheric&quot; soundtrack—the perfect contrast to the high-stakes gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Handcrafted Peril:</strong> Every level is a deliberate puzzle of enemies, obstacles, and secret corridors designed to reward patience and skill.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2325340/extras/d913fbdbc997e83c63abb85f832cc1b1.poster.avif?t=1777559648\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2325340/extras/d913fbdbc997e83c63abb85f832cc1b1.webm?t=1777559648\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2325340/extras/d913fbdbc997e83c63abb85f832cc1b1.mp4?t=1777559648\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Easy to learn, <strong>difficult to master</strong>. BeDo is a nostalgic, <strong>precision-driven journey</strong> for players who miss the pure challenge of platformers that also pack a compelling story.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2325340/extras/5f4e7ccf4b2aa550a9af07c8ece11760.poster.avif?t=1777559648\" width=800 height=446 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2325340/extras/5f4e7ccf4b2aa550a9af07c8ece11760.webm?t=1777559648\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2325340/extras/5f4e7ccf4b2aa550a9af07c8ece11760.mp4?t=1777559648\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Master Momentum</strong>: A Precision Platformer Without Jumping</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BeDo</strong> is a test of <strong>fluid movement</strong> set in a vibrant cosmos. Forget everything you know about platformers: here, there is <strong>no jump button</strong>. Your survival depends entirely on your ability to <strong>slide, dash, and glide</strong> with surgical precision.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2325340/extras/adac7e2a9b9aa004d1dfb7789c6cf532.poster.avif?t=1777559648\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2325340/extras/adac7e2a9b9aa004d1dfb7789c6cf532.webm?t=1777559648\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2325340/extras/adac7e2a9b9aa004d1dfb7789c6cf532.mp4?t=1777559648\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pilot a cute dough</strong> through the universe to defy the Somber Slumber that wants to shut off creation itself. It is accessible to start, but brutal for those seeking <strong>100% completion</strong>. Can you handle the momentum in a space filled with hazards?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2325340/extras/01a387e0803bbfcf6869fe6f18e9c2e4.poster.avif?t=1777559648\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2325340/extras/01a387e0803bbfcf6869fe6f18e9c2e4.webm?t=1777559648\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2325340/extras/01a387e0803bbfcf6869fe6f18e9c2e4.mp4?t=1777559648\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Movement-Based Precision:</strong> Full 360-degree control. Master the art of the spatial slide to navigate lethal traps.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Collector’s Odyssey:</strong> Discover 350 scattered pieces of Dough and 105 hidden planetoids across 40+ handcrafted levels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Subversive Atmosphere:</strong> A hypnotic lo-fi aesthetic paired with a &quot;dazzlingly atmospheric&quot; soundtrack—the perfect contrast to the high-stakes gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Handcrafted Peril:</strong> Every level is a deliberate puzzle of enemies, obstacles, and secret corridors designed to reward patience and skill.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2325340/extras/d913fbdbc997e83c63abb85f832cc1b1.poster.avif?t=1777559648\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2325340/extras/d913fbdbc997e83c63abb85f832cc1b1.webm?t=1777559648\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2325340/extras/d913fbdbc997e83c63abb85f832cc1b1.mp4?t=1777559648\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Easy to learn, <strong>difficult to master</strong>. BeDo is a nostalgic, <strong>precision-driven journey</strong> for players who miss the pure challenge of platformers that also pack a compelling story.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2325340/extras/5f4e7ccf4b2aa550a9af07c8ece11760.poster.avif?t=1777559648\" width=800 height=446 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2325340/extras/5f4e7ccf4b2aa550a9af07c8ece11760.webm?t=1777559648\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2325340/extras/5f4e7ccf4b2aa550a9af07c8ece11760.mp4?t=1777559648\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2></li></ul>", "short_description": "Navigate a lethal, vibrant cosmos with total 360° control. No jumping, just pure momentum-based skill. 40+ handcrafted levels packed with secrets and high-stakes precision. Easy to start, brutal to finish.", "supported_languages": "English", "reviews": "“BeDo delivers a unique cosmic adventure, where classic gaming nostalgia merges with the beauty of the farthest reaches of space.”<br><br>", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2325340/header.jpg?t=1777559648", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2325340/a3fb168dac58ca6a1fc264cef49ad76142e07b53/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1777559648", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2325340/a3fb168dac58ca6a1fc264cef49ad76142e07b53/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1777559648", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 SP1<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Dual-core 2.0 GHz or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</s